		(descr "1-cell LiPo pouch LP802540 (8.0 x 25 x 40 mm, ~800 mAh, with PCM), laid flat and stuck down with double-sided tape. No pads: its leads end in a PH1.25 2-pin plug that goes into the RP2350-Plus battery header. PCM and leads at the +X end. Board-only: the schematic symbol BT1 is not on the board, this footprint carries the outline and 3D model. Origin = cell centre")
